The shell scripts a human runs outside this package: `agent/audit.sh`, which runs the checks in
`AGENTS.md`'s table and prints what each cost; `agent/gen-surface.mjs`, which generates and
drift-checks `guides/eyg-surface.tsv`; `agent/doc-checks.mjs`, the five prose checks over this
package's documentation, one row each in the audit. Nothing in this tree runs them - the package
has no effect that starts a shell command, so a check is run by a person or a cron, never by the
tool.
